  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "好好工作  (Do Good Work)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "wang_er": "王尔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Senior producer Xingzi briskly calls Yin Zhengyu's agency right in front of them, then offers to mentor Bu Xiaogu, while Wang Er tells Xiaogu that solid work is the best thank-you. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你好，我们是星天娱乐公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们等你，好的，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在等他们回复，应该就是他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那就太好了，好厉害！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你这几天就跟着杏子姐姐，给她打打下手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "我相信你一定能学到不少东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "以后有什么不懂的地方，来找我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，杏子姐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "不用谢我，你要真想谢我，就好好工作。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go through each line. Xingzi places a quick, professional call to the talent agency.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你好，我们是星天娱乐公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, we are Xingtian Entertainment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们等你，好的，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will wait for you — alright, thank you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在等他们回复，应该就是他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now we wait for their reply; it should be him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那就太好了，好厉害！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then that is wonderful — you are amazing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你这几天就跟着杏子姐姐，给她打打下手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For the next few days, shadow Sister Xingzi and lend her a hand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "我相信你一定能学到不少东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I believe you will definitely learn quite a lot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "以后有什么不懂的地方，来找我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, if there is anything you do not understand, come find me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，杏子姐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Sister Xingzi!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "不用谢我，你要真想谢我，就好好工作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to thank me; if you really want to thank me, just work hard.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你好，我们是星天娱乐公司。",
      "gap": 0.5
